          "3dc073dbcbcb1a94"
        ],
        "source_urls": [
          "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/waseelaerozgar-jobopportunity-hiring-share-7528820692117712896-N5tR"
        ],
        "work_mode": "unknown",
        "description_status": "full",
        "job_level": "",
        "job_type": "",
        "kind": "lead",
        "source_title": "#waseelaerozgar #jobopportunity #hiring #fullstackdeveloper # ...",
        "source_description": "📢 FULL STACK DEVELOPER (REACT.JS, NEXT.JS, NESTJS, PHP)\n\nCompany: Imtiaz Group (Private) Limited\nLocation: Karachi\nPosition: Full Stack Developer (React.js, Next.js, NestJS, PHP)\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• React, Next.js, aur NestJS ka use karke responsive, accessible user interfaces aur robust applications build karna\n• RESTful aur GraphQL endpoints develop karna, aur SQL & NoSQL database schemas design & optimize karna\n• Frontend speed (Core Web Vitals, bundling) aur backend efficiency (caching, query tuning) enhance karna\n• Unit, integration, aur end-to-end tests ke sath clean aur maintainable code likhna\n• Agile workflows mein cross-functional teams ke sath partner karke features deliver karna aur production issues resolve karna\n\nRequirements:\n• Qualification: Computer Science, Engineering, ya related technical field mein Bachelor’s ya Master’s degree\n• Experience: Minimum 4+ years professional full stack development experience (jismein 3+ years React aur 2+ years Next.js & NestJS experience shamil ho)\n• Technical Skills: TypeScript (full-stack applications mein), RESTful APIs, GraphQL, SQL/NoSQL databases (e-commerce, fintech, ya high-traffic B2C applications ka experience preferred)\n\nHow to Apply:\n📩 Email CV: careers@imtiaz.com.pk\n💬 WhatsApp CV: 0326-3339777 (ya flyer par maujood QR code scan karein)\n⚠️ Email Subject Line: \"Full Stack Developer - Karachi\" likhna zaroori hai\n📅 Last Date to Apply: 22nd Nov, 2026\n\nSource: Imtiaz Group Official Hiring Announcement\n\nNote: Apply only through the official contact/application details provided above. No fee is charged by Waseela-e-Rozgar for sharing job opportunities.\n\nFollow Waseela-e-Rozgar for employment opportunities, career guidance, skills, community support and initiatives that help connect people with opportunities and support a more financially independent future.\n\n#WaseelaERozgar\n#JobOpportunity\n#Hiring\n#FullStackDeveloper\n#ReactJS\n#NextJS\n#NestJS\n#SoftwareEngineer\n#ImtiazGroup\n#KarachiJobs\n#JobsPakistan",
        "posted_at": "2026-11-18T14:05:31.983000+00:00",
